<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Spanish. English in res/values is the fallback for anything missing here.

    Spanish is the longest Latin-script locale here ("ESTRELLAS" is nine
    characters where the English "STARS" is five), so it is the case that sets
    the ceiling for the home stat plates and the pack selector. Those two
    controls ellipsize and wrap rather than clip; see GlassStatCard and
    PackSelector.

    Inverted punctuation (¡ and ¿) is used as it is written, not as in the
    English file.
-->
